# Build-critical scripts/ dir must ship in source archives.
# Root .gitignore's `scripts/` rule is now anchored to /scripts/ (repo root
# only), so this nested scripts/ dir is never matched. Kept as an explicit
# safeguard so a future un-anchoring of the root rule cannot silently drop
# build-provider-preload.mjs from EAS/Netlify archives.
!scripts/
